Category: Changed

A Docker Registry Node was added, which requires users to update their configuration files to point to the new registry address. The `docker_registry` variable in `globals.yml` has been updated to `10.10.13.2:5000`, and the `registry` variable in `kolla-build.conf` has also been changed to match this new value. This change affects users who need to build images from the Docker registry, requiring them to update their configuration files accordingly.
